# Density Compare
# Helium (He) — real density 0.00018 g/cm³. equal masses: Helium vs water — sides ∝ (1/ρ)^(1/3).
scene "Helium Density Compare"

element_cube = cube 353.9mm color: #d9ffff at (-20mm, 176.9mm, 0)
water_cube = cube 20mm material: water at (18mm, 10mm, 0)
# both cubes weigh the same: about 0.0 g — the water cube is the reference
